  "releaseNotes": "* Resolved an issue that caused extra spacing between record sets.\n* Resolved a column layout issue when specifying the columns and spacing.\n* Fixed a display issue where the page-level total was not shown correctly in the footer.\n* Addressed a PDF import error: \"Adler checksum doesn't match\", which occurred when importing certain PDFs and generating new ones.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": ".NET API for PDF development.  PDF creation, merging, form filling, stamping, securing/encryption and much more.  This SDK is easy to use and contains tons of features. It also supports .NET Standard2.0",
